</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am working on adding my public key to the KEYS for making a release.<br/>
However, I guess only PMC can push to the KEYS file.<br/>
I have attached a diff file, and would appreciate if someone can add my key to the KEYS file.<br/>
The reason I am asking for that is so I can call a vote on 1.8.2 rc since that will need my signature to be verified.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks
  </td>
