                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        AVRO-1918                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The IDL documentation lacks information for how annotations can be specified for logical types, like in the following example:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
