	at com.intellij.rt.execution.junit.JUnitStarter.main(JUnitStarter.java:70)<br/>
Caused by: org.apache.avro.AvroTypeException: Cannot encode decimal with scale 0 as scale 4<br/>
	at org.apache.avro.Conversions$DecimalConversion.toBytes(Conversions.java:92)<br/>
