                <tr id="issuerow13081795" rel="13081795" data-issuekey="AVRO-2045" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Avro
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="AVRO-2045" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/AVRO-2045">AVRO-2045</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Avro should warn about corrupt EOF files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Nandor Kollar
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Lars Volker
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Lars Volker
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 22/Jun/17 14:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jun/17 12:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.7.6            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When running queries on truncated files, Impala&#39;s Avro scanner issues a warning:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
WARNINGS: Problem parsing file hdfs://host.company.com:8020/tmp/datagen/some_db/some_table/col1=A/col2=B/col3=D/col4=C/2017-05-18-18-5-9-876-0.avro at 1327214080(EOF)<br/>
Tried to read 64653 bytes but could only read 16549 bytes. This may indicate data file corruption. (file hdfs://host.company.com:8020/tmp/datagen/some_db/some_table/col1=A/col2=B/col3=D/col4=C/2017-05-18-18-5-9-876-0.avro, byte offset: 1327214080)<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
{{avro-tools tojson}} eventually prints the same number of rows that Impala reads, but does not print a warning. Instead it seems to quietly swallow the EOFException.<br/>
<br/>
I think it should print a warning instead.<br/>

  </td>
